        "name": "Dawning Shadow",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Senna calls upon the relic stones of fallen Sentinels, splitting her relic cannon into a holy array of shadow and light. She then fires a global beam that shields allies from harm, while damaging enemies caught in the center.",
        "bodyHtml": "Senna fires a beam of light that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(250/400/550 + (70% Ability Power) + (115% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to all enemy champions hit. Allied champions hit in a wider area receive <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(121.5/161.5/201.5 + (50% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The shield's power scales with the amount of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mist</span> Senna has collected.</span>",
